  "body": "## Top level redirect\r\n\r\n1. https://redirect-session-history.glitch.me/\r\n2. Click \"Set cookie: Redirect next navigation to data URL\"\r\n3. Click \"Top-level actions\" > \"Navigate to /a\"\r\n\r\nChrome: Error page (unsafe redirect)\r\nFirefox: Stay on existing page\r\nSafari: Works\r\n\r\n## Iframe redirect\r\n\r\n1. https://redirect-session-history.glitch.me/\r\n2. Click \"Set cookie: Redirect next navigation to data URL\"\r\n3. Click \"iframe actions\" > \"Navigate to /a\"\r\n\r\nChrome: Error page in iframe\r\nFirefox: Works\r\nSafari: Works\r\n\r\n## New window\r\n\r\n1. https://redirect-session-history.glitch.me/\r\n2. Click \"Set cookie: Redirect next navigation to data URL\"\r\n3. Click \"New window actions\" > \"Navigate to /a\"\r\n\r\nChrome: Error page in new window\r\nFirefox: Closes new window\r\nSafari: Navigation hangs\r\n\r\n## Correct behaviour\r\n\r\nIt should either work or not work 😄. I don't think there's a security issue with it working, since data urls have an opaque origin.",
